    {
      "source": "Resolves a <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>JDBC dialect</code></a> by inspecting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/namedparam/NamedParameterJdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>NamedParameterJdbcOperations</code></a>.",
