    {
      "source": "Register custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>s in a <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions</code></a> object if required. These\n<a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions</code></a> will be registered with the\n<a href=\"#jdbcConverter(org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.mapping.JdbcMappingContext,org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam.NamedParameterJdbcOperations,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert.RelationResolver,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert.JdbcCustomConversions,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect.JdbcDialect)\"><code>jdbcConverter(JdbcMappingContext, NamedParameterJdbcOperations, RelationResolver, JdbcCustomConversions, JdbcDialect)</code></a>.\nReturns an empty <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions</code></a> instance by default.",
      "translation": "如果需要使用，可在 <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions</code></a> 对象中注册自定义的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>Converter</code></a>。这些 <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions</code></a> 将注册到 <a href=\"#jdbcConverter(org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.mapping.JdbcMappingContext,org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam.NamedParameterJdbcOperations,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert.RelationResolver,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert.JdbcCustomConversions,org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect.JdbcDialect)\"><code>jdbcConverter(JdbcMappingContext, NamedParameterJdbcOperations, RelationResolver, JdbcCustomConversions, JdbcDialect)</code></a> 中。默认情况下，返回一个空的 <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> for reuse in the <a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a> and the <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcConverter</code></a>.\nOverride this method to register a bean of type <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> if your use case requires a more\nspecialized <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为<a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>创建一个实现，以便在<a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core 中的接口\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a>和<a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>JdbcConverter</code></a>中复用。如果您的用例需要更专业的<a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>，请重写此方法以注册一个类型为<a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>的 Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> for reuse in the <a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a> and the <a href=\"../../core/convert/JdbcConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcConverter</code></a>.",
