    {
      "source": "Returns the base packages to scan for JDBC mapped entities at startup. Returns the package name of the\nconfiguration class' (the concrete class, not this one here) by default. So if you have a\n<code>com.acme.AppConfig</code> extending <a href=\"AbstractJdbcConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>AbstractJdbcConfiguration</code></a> the base package will be considered\n<code>com.acme</code> unless the method is overridden to implement alternate behavior.",
      "translation": "返回在启动时用于扫描 JDBC 映射实体的基础包。默认情况下，返回配置类（即具体类，而非此处所示的此类）的包名。因此，如果您有一个继承自 <a href=\"AbstractJdbcConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>AbstractJdbcConfiguration</code></a> 的 <code>com.acme.AppConfig</code>，则基础包将被视为 <code>com.acme</code>，除非重写该方法以实现其他行为。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Scans the mapping base package for classes annotated with <a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a>. By default, it scans for entities in all\npackages returned by <a href=\"#getMappingBasePackages()\"><code>getMappingBasePackages()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "扫描带有<a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>Table</code></a>注解的映射基础包中的类。默认情况下，它会扫描由<a href=\"#getMappingBasePackages()\"><code>getMappingBasePackages()</code></a>返回的所有包中的实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
