    {
      "source": "Scans the given base package for entities, i.e. JDBC-specific types annotated with <a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a>.",
